      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ra'anana",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Ra'anana gained local council status in 1936 and grew to 3,000 residents by Israel's founding in 1948.",
